{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A social sandbox where players hang out on a shared tropical beach island full of chaotic minigames and activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hang out around the beach and everything is interactable and every sand grain is simulated (not really, you wish).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And before you mention it, no there won\u2019t be fishing. Nothing personal, I just hate fishing. Ok fine, it\u2019s personal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there <i>will </i>be metal detectors. So you can go around, and uh, you know, metal detect. on the beach. to find coins. or gold. or bags of cash. to get rich. <i>obviously.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's basically like summer vacation but you don't have to physically go to the beach</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hang out with your friends, or complete strangers </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat (but don't forget what mom said about talking to strangers)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build sand castles, ruin your friend's sand castles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do a bunch of random stuff (throw sand balls at each other, surf, sell ice cream, eat icecream)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes there will be volleyball (but with absolutely terrible physics)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes you can bury your friends in the sand (but they might fall under the map)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes there will be crabs that steal your money, and seagulls that swoop down to steal your ice cream.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No there won't be fishing.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4154610?t=1762864763","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap